{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.poster.avif?t=1767088618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.webm?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/5b9f498430d18d3e833a355ce720ef64.mp4?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Tower Survivors is a horde survival game where you face relentless waves of enemies in intense 20-minute sessions, with over 100 unique skills to help you fend off the onslaught. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>Make different builds that are unique each game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.poster.avif?t=1767088618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.webm?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/79c4eeca2de2002fbeb55a1eeab26931.mp4?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Rebuild abandoned wizard tower to get more abilities, characters and weapons.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.poster.avif?t=1767088618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.webm?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/7f00ee66dafa0804a8ef1727ae62010d.mp4?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Skill System</strong>: Discover and master more than 100 character skills, allowing for limitless build combinations and strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Heroes and Weapons</strong>: Choose from a wide array of heroes and weaponry, each offering unique abilities and playstyles to keep each run fresh and exciting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Tower Management</strong>: Engage in a deep meta-game between battles. Build and upgrade your tower to gain passive bonuses, unlock new content, and strengthen your characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Sessions</strong>: Experience intense action in 20-minute runs designed for quick yet satisfying gameplay sessions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Enhancement</strong>: Benefit from a passive progression system where each run contributes to your overall power, encouraging continual growth and new tactical opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.poster.avif?t=1767088618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.webm?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/fd62b61938fd9a9c456e56f8f713f8e7.mp4?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight engaging bosses that will keep you on your toes and offer great rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.poster.avif?t=1767088618\" width=240 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.webm?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433850/extras/3491bfd3b2d7519f242590014449be04.mp4?t=1767088618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Survivor I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/ea6ea70c6edb2f5532b99c9cd3b408ddfd103d6c.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/8e7c7e5fb3c24a86a4595a7c77ad341d8a9dc598.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/5973a33789b045505b6b5a754df732c186b037ab.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer I","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/99eb66c86e1f56c4dc52fb882a26b6939a15f178.jpg"},{"name":"Let me show you a magic trick","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/1fb3cdf5dc3892a3174b6b9bdc0c7e5b3cd0044d.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/203be648b1ebc276a53b31fc0959b4b1ca0cd3c3.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer III","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2433850/9f8c68dd4dbe99eebe59340fe1bf02d58e563dc1.jpg"},{"